<title>UK: DSL unit sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit sets 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT BUND DUE APRIL 2006 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
